#!/bin/bash
# Plain-language list of the keys this setup added.
yad --title="Your shortcuts" --center --width=560 --height=420 --button=Close:0 --text-info --wrap <<'EOF'
ADDED BY XPS SETUP
  Super + F8     Control panel (big clickable buttons for everything)
  Super + F7     Task manager
  Super + F9     Voice typing: press once to listen, again to type
  Super + F10    AI assistant (works offline)

OMARCHY BASICS
  Super + Space        Find and open any app (type its name)
  Super + Alt + Space  Omarchy menu (settings, Wi-Fi, updates)
  Super + Return       Terminal
  Super + Q            Close the window
  Super + K            Show every shortcut
  Mouse                Top bar icons are clickable. Drag windows with Super + left button.

CLOSING THINGS
  Super + Q      Close the window       Ctrl + W   Close a browser tab
  Taskbar        Middle-click a window button to close it
  Ctrl+Shift+T   Bring back the last closed browser tab

MODES
  Coding time 13:00 - 18:00 weekdays (08:00 - 18:00 weekends): editor and builds get priority,
  notifications are paused. Free time: everything normal. Change times in "Mode times".
EOF
